<HR style='border:0;height:0;width:0;margin:14pt 0 0 0'><P align=center style='font:14pt Times New Roman;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt'><IMG src=ztex99z14_1.jpg width=298 height=116>&nbsp;</P>
